lass=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">13\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0012807500</span>12,807<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">3 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/Harbinger_of_Madness\" title=\"Harbinger of Madness\">Harbinger of Madness</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Elasticity\" title=\"Elasticity\">Elasticity</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Elasticity\" title=\"Elasticity\">Elasticity</a>:</b> This bow is strung with special fibers that cause it to occasionally launch arrows with shocking force. When rolling a 19 or 20 on a ranged attack, your critical multiplier is increased by +1.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Stealth_Strike\" title=\"Stealth Strike\">Stealth Strike</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Stealth_Strike\" title=\"Stealth Strike\">Stealth Strike</a>:</b> Reduces the threat generated by ranged attacks and spells by 15%.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Seeker\" title=\"Seeker\"> Seeker +8</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Seeker\" title=\"Seeker\"> Seeker +8</a>:</b> Provides a +8 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to confirm critical hits, and a +8 Enhancement bonus to critical hit damage (before multipliers are applied).</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Aligned\" title=\"Aligned\">Aligned</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Aligned\" title=\"Aligned\">Aligned</a>:</b> This weapon transmutes into a form that is able to bypass any alignment based Damage Reduction. (Chaotic, Good, Evil, Lawful)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Overfocus\" title=\"Overfocus\">Overfocus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Overfocus\" title=\"Overfocus\">Overfocus</a>:</b> This item helps you focus your attention, but it makes you somewhat oblivious to your surroundings, causing a -10 penalty to <a href=\"/page/Search\" title=\"Search\">Search</a> and <a href=\"/page/Spot\" title=\"Spot\">Spot</a>.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Bow_of_Sinew.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Bow_of_Sinew.png/420px-Bow_of_Sinew.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"580\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Bow_of_Sinew.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Catalyst_Crafting\" title=\"Catalyst Crafting\">Catalyst Crafting</a> to \n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Item:Demon%27s_Arc\" title=\"Item:Demon&#39;s Arc\">Demon's Arc</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Demon%27s_Arc\" title=\"Item:Legendary Demon&#39;s Arc\">Legendary Demon's Arc</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>A gruesome bow strung with the guts of some foul Xoriat beast. Though it is repulsive, the sinew it is constructed from makes it a more flexible, speedy and deadly weapon than other bows of its type.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>You can remove the <a href=\"/page/Overfocus\" title=\"Overfocus\">Overfocus</a> penalty with a <a href=\"/page/Sustaining_Symbiont\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sustaining Symbiont\">Sustaining Symbiont</a>.<br />\nThis bow has a 19-20 critical threat range calculated as the sum of a base 5% and a bonus 5%. The <a href=\"/page/Improved_Critical\" title=\"Improved Critical\">Improved Critical: Ranged Weapon</a> feat only applies to base value giving an improved range of 18-20.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817173603\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.098 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.162 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3896/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30587/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8842/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 2/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n144.43%  202.226     55 Template:IO\n100.00%  140.017      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  140.017      1 -total\n 97.50%  136.519      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 47.68%   66.759      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 46.96%   65.758      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 45.84%   64.189      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 45.06%   63.095      2 Template:InCategory\n 24.15%   33.816      9 Template:Popup\n 20.04%   28.057      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:14534-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817173603 and revision id 69358